{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_010203_p28_b8", "persona_id": "db:28", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "不要在客户未完全否定产品时主动引导对比竞品，应先尝试用其他优势（如手写体验、生态协同）重新锚定价值。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_010500"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260526_010203_p28_b8", "persona_id": "db:28", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "面对参数异议时，除了承认差距，更要强调产品在整体体验上的独特优势，例如MatePad的跨设备协同、笔记软件优化等。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260526_010500"}
